  "translation": "Today is Sunday. I go to a coffee shop with a friend. The coffee shop is in front of the school. We take a bus. After getting off the bus, we walked. There are many people in the coffee shop. We first find a chair to sit down. To the left, we saw a window. We often come here to drink coffee. My friend ordered milk. I also drink coffee. We both like coffee. My friend can make coffee, so his coffee is very sweet. I can drink a lot of coffee. My friend is a good person. He read this book and was very happy. I come from home. I drank a mouthful of water. I was drinking coffee when my friend asked me: 'How did you come?' I said: 'By bus.' He asked again: 'What did you drink?' I said: 'Coffee.' Then he pointed at that cup of water and said: 'Right, that looks nice.' Coffee is three yuan. We chatted for two hours. In the afternoon we went home. At the door, my friend said: 'Next time don't forget to bring money.' Coffee tastes best. We also walked home."
